OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start across western
OL,6,Fareas. Rain then quickly moving
OL,7,Fnortheastwards through the morning.
OL,8,FDrier and somewhat brighter skies
OL,9,Ffollowing across England and Wales for
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Turning increasingly
OL,11,Fwindy, especially in the west. Mild in
OL,12,Fthe south.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FAnother band of heavy rain
OL,15,Fmoving into western areas through the
OL,16,Fevening, spreading eastwards across
OL,17,Fthe rest of the UK overnight. Widely
OL,18,Fvery windy, with severe gales across
OL,19,Fnorthwest Scotland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
