OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly rain clearing to sunny
OL,6,Fspells and showers. Showers heaviest
OL,7,Fand most frequent in the northwest.
OL,8,FAnother windy day, with severe gales
OL,9,Facross parts of Scotland in
OL,10,Fparticular. Feeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
